# BIZFLOW AFRICA
## COMPLETE MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

### 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack developer, database engineer, UI/UX designer, cybersecurity engineer, and SaaS product developer.

Build **BizFlow Africa**, a complete, professional, scalable, multi-tenant business management platform.

BizFlow Africa will help businesses manage their operations using one centralized system.

The platform will initially target Rwanda and later expand into other African countries.

**Brand name:** BizFlow Africa

**Tagline:** One Platform. Multiple Businesses. Complete Business Management.

**Main goal:** Build a real commercial SaaS application that businesses can register for, subscribe to, and use to manage their daily activities.

This must be a fully functional application, not a static dashboard, school project, or frontend-only prototype.

